flowchart TD
    A[Multipart request] --> B[Multer writes to public/temp]
    B --> C[Controller receives local file path]
    C --> D[Cloudinary upload]
    D -->|Success| E[Store returned media URL]
    D -->|Failure| F[Return upload failure]
    E --> G[Attempt local file cleanup]
    F --> H[Current cleanup can throw if file already absent]
    B --> I[Original filename used; no explicit size/type filter]
